Dia tidak pernah melukis lagi.

228
00:17:06,759 --> 00:17:08,228
Apa?  Apa maksudmu?

229
00:17:11,564 --> 00:17:12,932
John?

230
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:17,104
John?

231
